    {
      "_id": 11482,
      "id": "thunderbolt_strike",
      "name": "Thunderbolt Strike",
      "description": "Follows his hunter's instincts. Tap or hold to produce different effects as well as apply the <b><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Hunter's Mark</span></b> effect to the hit opponents.<br/><br/><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Tapping</span><br/>Fires at opponents in front of him, dealing <span style=\"color:#FFACFFFF\">AoE Electro DMG</span>.<br/><br/><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Holding</span><br/>Enters aiming mode, then targets opponents within a certain area in front of him. Alyosha's Interruption RES is enhanced when in this mode.<br/>At the end of the button hold, he deals <span style=\"color:#FFACFFFF\">Electro DMG</span> to the targeted opponents.",
      "info": "The reckless hunter once reached for the spear's edge, and it was only after they survived a lesson paid in blood that they came to understand the harsh truths of survival on the frozen plains.",
