    {
      "_id": 11485,
      "id": "hunters_advance",
      "name": "Hunter's Advance",
      "description": "Summons his trusted companion <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Tugarin</span> to fight alongside him on the field. This also turns an area in front of him into a <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Fulgurite Hunting Field</span> for a short time.<br/><br/><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Fulgurite Hunting Field</span><br/>· Continuously taunts nearby opponents to incite them to attack.<br/>· Every 2s, deals an instance of <span style=\"color:#FFACFFFF\">AoE Electro DMG</span> to any opponent that enters the field.<br/><br/><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Tugarin</span><br/>· If there are any opponents nearby, Tugarin will quickly move close to an opponent and maul them every 2s, dealing <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Electro DMG</span>.<br/>· If an opponent affected by the <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Hunter's Mark</span> effect is hit, the <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Hunter's Mark</span> will also be activated.<br/>· Where there are multiple opponents, Tugarin will attack those affected by the <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Hunter's Mark</span> effect first.",
      "info": "Wait. Keep waiting until the impatience fades. That's when the red-bellied plover shall sweep across the birch grove and present itself before one's arrow.",
